# Copyrighted assets

This is a Nintendo game port. The US ROM and anything extracted from it stay on disk, never in git.

Do not add or stage:

- `zelda3.sfc`, `*.sfc`, `*.smc`
- `zelda3_assets.dat`
- `tables/`
- extracted `assets/` dumps (overworld/dungeon yaml, `img/`, `sprites/*.png`, `sound/`, dialogue, fonts, `linksprite.png`, `hud_icons.png`)
- `saves/`, `*.o`, the `zelda3` binary

Do not paste ROM bytes, map16 tables, or ripped graphics into commits, PRs, or issue text.

`git add` only named source paths. If `git status` shows a `.sfc` or `zelda3_assets.dat`, stop.
